00:58:09.830 --> 00:58:14.980
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia, who warns you, if you do not pledge to your public radio station--

00:58:14.980 --> 00:58:19.130
<v Peter Sagal>You will fall into iniquity, and I will know. And you shall have no dessert.

00:58:19.130 --> 00:58:23.040
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life.

00:58:23.040 --> 00:58:53.710
<v Peter Sagal>And now behold, even as I have said, it has come to pass.

00:58:53.710 --> 00:58:58.710
<v Announcer>PRI, Public Radio International.
